1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,573
The numbers hid a district of silent injuries.

2
00:00:02,573 --> 00:00:17,415
A consultant brought a systematic review to the council chamber: the edge of the table was worn where the same three people had signed in every day, and the width of the corridor told its own story about who could take part.

3
00:00:17,415 --> 00:00:26,864
“Somebody has to make the body a place we send people to,” she said, “not a place we take them from.”

4
00:00:26,864 --> 00:00:38,412
The chest, the shirt, the cheek, and the forehead of a young athlete were photographed for the report; a surgeon in a separate office read the file with a neutral face.

5
00:00:38,412 --> 00:00:43,091
“The horror is not the injury,” the consultant said.

6
00:00:43,091 --> 00:00:55,984
“It is the fantasy that a brave person does not need an arrow pointing home.” Her accent was from the north, and her silence after that sentence was intense.

7
00:00:55,984 --> 00:01:08,587
The systematic part of the work was ugly: a triangular diagram, a multiplication of small risks, and a tidy list of alterations to the training week.

8
00:01:08,587 --> 00:01:13,586
“Maturity is not durability,” the biologist said.

9
00:01:13,586 --> 00:01:26,574
“A young body can withstand a season, and the handicap arrives in the tenth.” The rivalry between the two squads had compelled them to hide a miserable truth.

10
00:01:26,574 --> 00:01:31,528
The numbers were paradoxical and the brilliance of them was misleading.

11
00:01:31,528 --> 00:01:44,436
A genius with a systematic mind, a brow full of sweat, and a skirt of afternoon light on the floor: the picture said nothing about the developmental cost of the programme.

12
00:01:44,436 --> 00:01:48,395
“Refine the measure,” the consultant said.

13
00:01:48,395 --> 00:01:53,384
“Make it perceptive, not just forceful.”

14
00:01:53,384 --> 00:02:08,102
The review concluded with a plea that was not in the data: an abusive schedule, however effective, is a stupid one; the stupidity is not in the numbers, it is in the question we never ask.

15
00:02:08,102 --> 00:02:13,661
They sent the report to the council and brought it to the court of public opinion.

16
00:02:13,661 --> 00:02:24,034
For the first time in a day, the quietest person in the room was able to make the whole argument in one sentence: a body is not a bank.

17
00:02:24,034 --> 00:02:36,347
A separate list, a systematic edge, and a district of silent injuries: the council, the court, and the day itself could make room for what the numbers had hidden.

18
00:02:36,347 --> 00:02:42,536
He had to bring the place, take the move, and send the report again.

19
00:02:42,536 --> 00:02:50,355
Might was not the same as a complicated machine, and they had to go back to the number that nobody had taken.

20
00:02:50,355 --> 00:02:54,025
“The heart of it is simple,” she said.

21
00:02:54,025 --> 00:03:02,069
“If the plan does not involve the slowest person in the district, it is not a plan.”
